        "type": "practiceLevel2",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148030,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mark out the code that belongs to these functions.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"114\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"healPlayer\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player healed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"healPlayer();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>{</code> followed by <code>}</code> and then <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148031,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why do we create functions?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">To group and reuse related code</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">To separate related code</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">To make it easier to create variables</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">To group and reuse related code.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148032,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when we call a function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The code inside the function runs</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">All the code inside the function is stored in a variable</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">A while loop is created inside the function</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The code inside the function runs.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148033,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Finish calling the function by coding its name.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"115\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot; points&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score + label);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displayScore();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>displayScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148034,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"startLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"startLevel();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level started&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code> on one line and <code>Level started</code> on the next</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Level started</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> on one line and <code>Level started</code> on the next.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is the parameter in this function?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addItemToInventory\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>item</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>text</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">There is no parameter</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>item</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Call the function and pass it a value.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"118\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"removeItemFromInventory\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dropped: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"removeItemFromInventory(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Health Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>removeItemFromInventory</code>, followed by <code>\"Health Potion\"</code>, and finally <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148037,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What are parameters for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Parameters help us pass specific information to functions</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parameters make it easier to call functions</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Parameters allow us to display variables in the console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Parameters help us pass specific information to functions.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148038,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add a parameter to the function and then call it with a value.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"115\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"updatePlayerHealth\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player health:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(health);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"updatePlayerHealth(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>health</code>, followed by <code>60</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148039,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Finish calling the function.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"94\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addScore\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"amount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot; points&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(amount + label);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"addScore(\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>addScore</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148040,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What happens when we add a return value to a function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The function returns a value to the code that calls it</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The function can no longer use display statements</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It means we'll only be able to call the function once</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The function returns a value to the code that calls it.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148041,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How do we end up returning <code>undefined</code> from our function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">By forgetting to add the <code>return</code> statement</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">By not including any display statements in our code</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">By calling the function with a parameter</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">By forgetting to add the <code>return</code> statement.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148042,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Create a <code>result</code> variable and store the result of calling the function with a value inside it.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"return\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"81\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"isBossLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level &gt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = isBossLevel(\" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>const</code> followed by <code>result</code> and then <code>isBossLevel</code>, <code>14</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Return the variable from this function.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"getPlayerHealth\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"67\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getPlayerHealth());}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148044,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displayLevelUnlocked\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level unlocked: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" text = displayLevelUnlocked(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(text);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Level unlocked: 5</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nothing displays in the console</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Level unlocked: 5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
